  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The stoichiometric reaction of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>516</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of dimethyldichlorosilane with water results in a tetrameric cyclic product <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">X</mi></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>75</mn><mo>%</mo></math> yield. The weight (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>) of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">X</mi></math> obtained is ____________</p><p>[Use, molar mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msup><mi>gmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>Si</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>Cl</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>]</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "222",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The dimethyldichlorosilane is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SiCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>. The molecular mass is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>129</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></math>.</p><p>Number of moles of dimethyldichlorosilane initially taken&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>516</mn><mn>129</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>moles</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0000_fca0c90ca6a1.png\" style=\"width: 438px; height: 215px;\" /></p><p>Applying POAC on Si atom</p><p>Moles of tetrameric cyclic product formed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>75</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>moles</mi></math></p><p>Molar mass of product formed&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>296</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>moles</mi></math></p><p>The mass of product formed&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>296</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>222</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
